---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { WaveBackground, FlowingLines, CornerWaves } from '../components/WaveArt';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Staticfish" description="Privacy Policy for Staticfish web development services.">
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-background">
    <Header />
    
    <main class="flex-1">
      
      <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
        <FlowingLines count={8} />
        <CornerWaves position="bottom-right" />
        <div class="mb-16 relative z-10">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Legal</p>
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-foreground sm:text-6xl mb-6">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground font-medium">Last updated: April 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-muted-foreground relative z-10">
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            Staticfish ("I", "me", "my") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how I collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit my website or use my services.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Information I Collect</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-4"><strong class="text-foreground">Information you provide:</strong></p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Name and contact information (email, phone)</li>
            <li>Business information</li>
            <li>Project requirements and specifications</li>
            <li>Payment information (processed securely via Stripe)</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-4"><strong class="text-foreground">Automatically collected information:</strong></p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 space-y-2">
            <li>IP address</li>
            <li>Browser type and version</li>
            <li>Pages visited and time spent</li>
            <li>Referring website</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">How I Use Your Information</h2>
          
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 space-y-2">
            <li>To provide and maintain my services</li>
            <li>To communicate with you about your project</li>
            <li>To process payments</li>
            <li>To improve my website and services</li>
            <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Data Storage and Security</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-6">
            I take data security seriously. Your information is stored securely using industry-standard encryption and security measures. I use Cloudflare for website security and Stripe for secure payment processing. I never store your credit card information.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Third-Party Services</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-4">I use the following third-party services:</p>
          
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong class="text-foreground">Cloudflare</strong> - Website hosting and security</li>
            <li><strong class="text-foreground">Stripe</strong> - Payment processing</li>
            <li><strong class="text-foreground">Email service providers</strong> - Communication</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-6">
            These services have their own privacy policies and may collect data according to their terms.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Cookies</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-6">
            My website uses minimal cookies for essential functionality and analytics. You can control cookie settings through your browser.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Your Rights</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-4">Under GDPR and UK data protection laws, you have the right to:</p>
          
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Access your personal data</li>
            <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
            <li>Object to data processing</li>
            <li>Request data portability</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-6">
            To exercise these rights, email me at contact@staticfish.co.uk
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Data Retention</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-6">
            I retain your information for as long as necessary to provide services and comply with legal obligations. Project-related data is typically retained for 2 years after project completion.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-6">
            I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. I will notify you of any significant changes by email or through a notice on my website.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Contact Me</h2>
          
          <p class="mb-6">
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how I handle your data, please contact me:
          </p>
          
          <div class="border border-border p-6 mb-12">
            <p class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Staticfish</p>
            <p class="mb-1">Email: contact@staticfish.co.uk</p>
            <p>Data Controller: Michael Fisher</p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>